Item ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(11)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202609251013045880051.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9.3 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Einfold \n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9.3 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG STRIX B850-F Gaming WiFi motherboard offers an impressive mix of features, designed specifically for gamers and PC enthusiasts looking to unlock the full potential of their AMD Ryzen processors. Whether you’re a competitive gamer or a content creator, this motherboard offers performance, connectivity, and customization options that make it stand out in its class.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>03/30/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of 9.3 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://einfoldtech.com/2025/03/asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi-unleashing-gaming-power/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202502072112451510663.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwarezoom Purchase recommendation\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardwarezoom\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwarezoom Purchase recommendation</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Performance users can buy without hesitation!\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/26/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Hardwarezoom Purchase recommendation\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarezoom.net/artikel/ASUS_ROG_Strix_B850_F_Gaming_WIFI_Test_Review-56885\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202501071453028500885.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      pcmasters.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Das ASUS ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI ist eine überzeugende Option für Nutzer, die eine aktualisierte und funktionsreiche Plattform mit AMDs B850 Chipsatz suchen. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/06/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.pcmasters.de/testbericht/133713972-asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi-test-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202405142213351890115.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Innovation Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pause Hardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Innovation Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix B850-F Gaming WiFi is technically a good card, with an intuitive BIOS and uncompromising Gen 5 SSD support. [...] If you're looking for a well-equipped B850, the ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI is a good technical choice.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>02/12/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Innovation Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pausehardware.com/test-asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202502051635231600473.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix B850-F Gaming WiFi packs a punch in the B850 motherboard category, giving you plenty of solid features at a competitive price point. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>06/24/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/review/asus-rog-strix-b850f-gaming-wifi-motherboard-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202501291655025280271.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Excellent\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Technology Insider\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Excellent</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Strix B850-F Gaming WiFi is an attractive board. It has many modern features, such as fast wired and wireless network connections. Also, the board can handle fast PCI Express 5.0 processors, and the slot for the video card can accommodate fast gpu's.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>02/19/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Excellent\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.technologyinsider.nl/index.php/artikelen/hardware/moederborden/64932-asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi-review-een-am5-moederbord-met-een-goede-balans.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202502051640367850257.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techgaming.nl\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      We've said it several times in this review, but one thing is for sure: Are you looking for a top-of-the-line B850 motherboard with a PCIe 5.0 x16 slot? Then the ROG Strix B850-F Gaming WiFi is a great candidate.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>01/06/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techgaming.nl/review-asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1225/202311172248383340112.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9/10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      MKAU Gaming Australia\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9/10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS is determined to make building your PC more accessible, and the ROG STRIX B850-F Gaming WiFi Motherboard continues the trend. Internal I/O ports are strategically placed around the board in easy-to-reach locations, while easy-to-use Q-Systems enable quick and easy replacement of components. Whether this is your first build or you want to update your existing system, the ROG STRIX B850-F Gaming WiFi Motherboard is an incredible starting point.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>AUSTRALIA</span> <span>02/21/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI Media review Award of 9/10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.mkaugaming.com/all-review-list/asus-rog-strix-b850-f-gaming-wifi-motherboard-hardware-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49