s down while choosing a motherboard for the Ryzen 9000 series, be sure to check out ASUS's feature-rich and robust B850 models!\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      AKIBA PC Hot line!\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>JAPAN</span> <span>09/12/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI media of AKIBA PC Hot line!\" href=\"https://akiba-pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/special/2044721.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Overclockers.ua\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202505141624520190268.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      Is an excellent choice for fans of the Republic of Gamers series who need high-quality overclocking for a flagship processor, as well as the ability to upgrade to newer processors without having to completely replace the platform.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Overclockers.ua\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>04/28/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-F GAMING WIFI med